-link\">Wall Maria</a>.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Member Of:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/warrior-unit\" class=\"entity-link\">Marley Warrior Unit</a>\n            — Bertholdt is a <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/marley\" class=\"entity-link\">Marley</a> Warrior.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/survey-corps\" class=\"entity-link\">Survey Corps</a>\n            — Bertholdt Hoover is connected to <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/survey-corps\" class=\"entity-link\">Survey Corps</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/warrior-unit/reiner-braun\" class=\"entity-link\">Reiner Braun</a>\n            — Bertholdt Hoover is connected to <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/warrior-unit/reiner-braun\" class=\"entity-link\">Reiner Braun</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/marley\" class=\"entity-link\">Marley</a>\n            — Bertholdt Hoover is connected to <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/marley\" class=\"entity-link\">Marley</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/titans\" class=\"entity-link\">Titans</a>\n            — Bertholdt Hoover is connected to <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/titans\" class=\"entity-link\">Titans</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/paradis/wall-maria/shiganshina\" class=\"entity-link\">Shiganshina District</a>\n            — <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/paradis/wall-maria/shiganshina\" class=\"entity-link\">Shiganshina District</a> is connected to Bertholdt Hoover through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/survey-corps/armin-arlert\" class=\"entity-link\">Armin Arlert</a>\n            — <a href=\"/attack-on-titan/survey-corps/armin-arlert\" class=\"entity-link\">Armin Arlert</a> is connected to Bertholdt Hoover through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Every edge is another route through the subject. Expand a group\n        to see how these threads fit together.\n    </p>\n\n    \n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Connected To</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">6</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"topic-examples\">\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/attack-on-titan/survey-corps\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Survey Corps</strong>\n                    <span>Military branch that explores beyond the Walls.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/attack-on-titan/warrior-unit/reiner-braun\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Reiner Braun</strong>\n                    <span>Armored Titan and Marley Warrior.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/attack-on-titan/marley\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Marley</strong>\n                    <span>Continental power that oppresses Eldians.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n    